EVTDESCroberts_rebellion.4;After Prince Rhaegar took Lyanna Stark into his care, Brandon Stark had the temerity to demand his life! I have had him and his father rightfully executed and now Eddard Stark, Robert Baratheon and his allies rise up against me.;Apr�s que le Prince Rhaegar ait pris sous son aile Lyanna Stark, son fr�re Brandon Stark a eu l�audace de para�tre devant moi en exigeant sa t�te. J��tais dans mes droits en les faisant ex�cuter lui et son p�re, mais voil� qu�� pr�sent Eddard Stark, Robert Baratheon et leurs alli�s se soul�vent contre moi.;;;Despu�s que el Pr�ncipe Rhaegar tomara a Lyanna Stark, su hermano Brandon Stark tuvo la temeridad de exigirme que la devolviera. Evidentemente lo ejecut� junto a su padre por traidores y ahora Eddad Stark,  Robert Baratheon y sus aliados se han alzado contra m�.;;;;;;;;;x
