EVTDESC6461;[From.GetTitledFirstName] has always been known to have fits of madness, but this surely tops them all. We have had word from [From.Capital.GetName] that [From.GetSheHe] has organized a trial by combat to prove [Root.GetHerHis] innocence, of what, no one seems to know. [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] will do battle with the [From.GetTitle]...;[From.GetTitledFirstName] a toujours �t� connu pour ses excentricit�s, mais l� on atteint des sommets. On rapporte de [From.Capital.GetName]qu'[From.GetSheHe] a organis� un duel judiciaire pour prouver son innocence. Innocence de quoi ? Personne ne sait vraiment. [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] va se battre contre le(a) [From.GetTitle]...;;;[From.GetTitledFirstName] siempre ha sido conocido por sus excentricidades, pero ahora ha batido todos los registros. Noticias desde [From.Capital.GetName] dicen que ha organizado un juicio por combate para demostrar su inocencia. Inocencia de qu�? Nadie lo sabe. [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] luchar� contra el [From.GetTitle]...;;;;;;;;;x
