EVTDESCimprisoned.200A;After many days of forceful questioning, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] has finally confessed to [From.GetHerHis] crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] has signed a letter: 'I, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], hereby confess to the crimes of conspiracy and sedition against [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], and hence the realm. I submit myself to [Root.GetHerHis] judgment'.;Apr�s de nombreux jours de questions muscl�es, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] a finalement avou� les crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] a sign� une lettre : 'Moi, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], par la pr�sente, avoue les crimes de conspiration et de s�dition contre [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], et donc le royaume. Je me soumets au jugement de [Root.GetHerHis]'.;;;;;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCimprisoned.200B;After many days of forceful questioning, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] has finally confessed to [From.GetHerHis] crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] has signed a letter: 'I, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], hereby confess to the crime of abusing my office via corrupt means, and in doing so dishonouring the good [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal]'.;Apr�s de nombreux jours de questions muscl�es, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] a finalement avou� les crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] a sign� une lettre : 'Moi, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], par la pr�sente, confesse d'avoir abus� de mon autorit� par des moyens ill�gaux, et, se faisant, d�shonorant le bon [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal]'.;;;;;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCimprisoned.200C;After many days of forceful questioning, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] has finally confessed to [From.GetHerHis] crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] has signed a letter: 'I, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], hereby confess to the crime of murder, and hereby submit myself to the judgment of [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal]'.;Apr�s de nombreux jours de questions muscl�es, [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] a finalement avou� les crimes. [From.GetSheHeCap] a sign� une lettre: 'Moi, [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyNoRegnal], par la pr�sente, confesse avoir commis le crime de meurtre, et me soumets au jugement de [Root.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal]'.;;;;;;;;;;;;x
