call_a_great_council_desc;The succession to [This.PrimaryTitle.GetName] is unclear, [This.Heir.GetTitledFirstName] being a questionable heir. [This.GetTitledFirstName] can call a Great Council of the lords of the realm, to determine who should be [This.GetHerHis] heir.;La succession de [This.PrimaryTitle.GetName] est litigieuse, [This.Heir.GetTitledFirstName] ne faisant pas l'unanimit� comme h�ritier. [This.GetTitledFirstName] peut convoquer un Grand Conseil pour r�unir les seigneurs du royaume et d�terminer qui est l'h�ritier de [This.GetHerHis].;;;La sucesi�n de [This.PrimaryTitle.GetName] no est� clara, [This.Heir.GetTitledFirstName] es un heredero cuestionable. [This.GetTitledFirstName] puede convocar un Gran Consejo con los Se�ores del Reino, para determinar quien deber�a ser el heredero.;;;;;;;;;x
