EVTDESCdynasty.21;[Root.GetTitledFirstName], your lawful liege, [From.GetTitledFirstName], hereby summons you to [From.Capital.GetName], where a great council of the nobles of [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] is to be held. There the succession to [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] shall be settled once and for all.\n\nSigned\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] of House [From.GetOnlyDynastyName], the [From.GetRegnalOrdinal] of [From.GetHerHis] name;[Root.GetTitledFirstName], votre suzerain l�gitime, [From.GetTitledFirstName], vous convoque � [From.Capital.GetName], o� un grand conseil des nobles de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] va se tenir. D'importantes d�cisions concernant le royaume doivent y �tre prises.\n\nSign�\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] de la Maison [From.GetOnlyDynastyName], [From.GetRegnalOrdinal] de son nom.;;;[Root.GetTitledFirstName], su se�or leg�timo, por la presente convoca [From.GetTitledFirstName], para viajar hacia [From.Capital.GetName], donde un gran consejo de los nobles de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] se llevar� a cabo. All� se discutir�n asuntos importantes relacionados con el futuro del reino. \ N \ nSigned \ n [From.GetTitledFirstName] de la Casa [From.GetOnlyDynastyName];;;;;;;;;x
