EVTDESCdynasty.22;[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] has called a great council to settle the succession to [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetName], and has summoned all landed nobles of the realm to [FromFrom.Capital.GetName] to attend. As regent to [From.GetTitledFirstName] I must attend, so that [From.GetSheHe] and [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] will have a voice.;[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] r�unit un grand conseil pour d�terminer la succession de [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetName], et a convoqu� tous les nobles du royaume de [FromFrom.Capital.GetName]. En tant que r�gent de [From.GetTitledFirstName] je dois y participer, pour parler au nom de [From.GetSheHe] [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName].;;;[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] ha convocado un Gran Consejo para resolver la sucesi�n de [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetName] y ha convocado a todos los Se�ores en [FromFrom.Capital.GetName] para participar.Como regente de [From.GetTitledFirstName] tengo que ir all� en su nombre, y representar a [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName].;;;;;;;;;x
