EVTDESCdynasty.24;Our journey to [From.Capital.GetName] is complete, we have arrived for the great council. We have been welcomed into [From.GetTitledFirstName]'s hospitality , and once all the nobles of [From.GetTitledFirstName] have arrived a feast shall begin.;Notre voyage vers [From.Capital.GetName] est termin�, nous sommes arriv� au grand conseil. Nous avons �t� accueillis par [From.GetTitledFirstName] et lorsque tous les nobles de [From.GetTitledFirstName] seront arriv�s le banquet pourra commencer.;;;Nuestro viaje a [From.Capital.GetName] est� terminado, hemos llegado al Gran Consejo.[From.GetTitledFirstName] nos ha recibido hospitalariamente , y una vez que todos los nobles de [From.GetTitledFirstName] lleguen, comenzar�n los festejos.;;;;;;;;;x
