EVTDESCdynasty.37;The great council is finally over, with every important noble in the realm having had their say. The votes have been counted and [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] has been declared the winner! [FromFrom.GetSheHeCap] is immediately presented before the assembled lords in a grand ceremony, and is formally named heir to [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName] by [From.GetTitle] [From.GetFirstName].;Le grand conseil est finalement termin�, tous les nobles importants du royaume ont pu donner leur opinion. Le d�compte des votes a �t� effectu� et [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] est d�clar� vainqueur. [FromFrom.GetSheHeCap] est pr�sent� imm�diatement devant les nobles assembl�s lors d'une grande c�r�monie et est officiellement nomm� h�ritier de [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetName] par [From.GetTitle] [From.GetFirstName].;;;El Gran Consejo ha finalizado, todos los Se�ores del Reino han podido dar su opini�n. El recuento de los votos ha acabado y [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] ha sido declarado vencedor. [FromFrom.GetSheHeCap] se ha reunido inmediatamente ante los nobles en una gran ceremonia y ha sido oficialmente nombrado heredero de [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetName] por [From.GetTitle] [From.GetFirstName].;;;;;;;;;x
