EVTDESCfeast.723;By all accounts [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName]'s feast in [FromFrom.Capital.GetName] was going great, that is until [FromFrom.GetSheHe] outrageously broke  [From.GetTitledFirstName]'s guest right and had [From.GetHerHim] arrested! Apparently [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] desires to forcably revoke a title from [From.GetHerHim], and so took this grievous action.;La f�te de [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] � [FromFrom.Capital.GetName] se passait bien sur tous les plans jusqu'� ce qu'[FromFrom.GetSheHe] brisa outrageusement les droits d'invit�s de [From.GetTitledFirstName] et [From.GetHerHim] fit arr�ter ! Apparemment, [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] souhaite retirer de force un titre de [From.GetHerHim], ce qui explique cette action discutable.;;;La fiesta de [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] en [FromFrom.Capital.GetName] transcurr�a con normalidad hasta que [FromFrom.GetSheHe] viol� las leyes de la hospitalidad haciendo arrestar a [From.GetTitledFirstName]! Aparentemente, [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstName] deseaba retirar por la fuerza un t�tulo de [From.GetHerHim], lo que explica esta discutible acci�n.;;;;;;;;;x
