faction_republic_desc;Members seek to force [This.Liege.GetTitledName] to abolish the monarchy and abdicate in favour of a new republic or oligarchy led by [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]. When sufficiently powerful, �Y[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�! may present an ultimatum to �Y[From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�!.;Les membres cherchent � abolir la monarchie et � une abdication en faveur d'une nouvelle r�publique dirig�e par [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]. Lorsque le complot sera suffisamment puissant, �Y[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�! pourra pr�senter un ultimatum � �Y[From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�!.;;;Los miembros buscan abolir la monarqu�a mediante una abdicaci�n a favor de una nueva rep�blica dirigida por [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]. Cuando el complot sea lo suficientemente potente, �Y[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�! podr� presentar un ultim�tum a �Y[From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitleNoRegnal]�!.;;;;;;;;;x
