EVTDESCfaction_event_new.68;[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] has successfully overthrown the [FromFromFrom.GetOnlyDynastyName] monarchy, and has established a new council of nobles ro rule in its place led by [From.GetHerHim]self. Our own [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] is threatened by this, and so must disown this coup.;[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] a r�ussi � renverser la monarchie de [FromFromFrom.GetOnlyDynastyName] et � �tablir un nouveau conseil de nobles, men� par [From.GetHerHim], pour diriger � la place. Notre propre [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] est menac� par tout cela et doit se d�marquer de ce putsch.;;;[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] ha logrado derrocar la monarqu�a de [FromFromFrom.GetOnlyDynastyName] y establecer un nuvo consejo de nobles, liderado per �l mismo, para gobernar. Nuestro propio [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] est� amenazado por todo este asunto y por ello debemos repudiar este golpe.;;;;;;;;;x
