faction_claimant_regent_coup_desc;With enough support, [Root.GetTitledFirstName] can use [Root.GetHerHis] powers as [Root.GetLordLady] Regent to depose [Root.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] in favour of [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] in a bloodless coup.;Avec assez de soutien, [Root.GetTitledFirstName] peut user de son pouvoir en tant que [Root.GetLordLady] r�gent(e) pour d�poser [Root.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] en faveur de [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] dans un coup d'�tat sanglant.;;;Con el suficiente apoyo, [Root.GetTitledFirstName] puede usar su poder como regente para deponer a [Root.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] en favor de [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] en un golpe incruento.;;;;;;;;;x
EVTTOOLTIPfaction_event_new.80;[This.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] is deposed in a coup\n;[This.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] est d�pos� par un coup d'�tat\n;;;[This.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] ha sido depuesto en un golpe\n;;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCfaction_event_new.80;[From.GetLordLady] Regent [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] has due to hold court today, but has had you abruptly imprisoned before it began. It transpires [From.GetSheHe] and [From.GetherHis] fellow conspirators have had you deposed in a coup! They have installed [From.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [From.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] as ruler of [From.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName] in your place.;Le(la) [From.GetLordLady] R�gent(e) [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] doit tenir audience ce jour, mais vous a brusquement emprisonn� avant le d�but. Il semble que lui/elle et ses co-conspirateurs accomplissent un coup d'�tat pour vous d�poser. Ils ont institu� [From.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [From.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] comme dirigeant de [From.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName] � votre place.;;;Hoy ten�a una audiencia con el regente [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty], pero de camino a el me han apresado. Parece que ] y sus compinches me han depuesto de un golpe! Han instaurado a [From.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [From.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] como dirigente del [From.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName] en mi lugar.;;;;;;;;;x
EVTOPTAEVTDESCfaction_event_new.80;Traitors!;Tra�tres !;;;Traidores!;;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCfaction_event_new.81;The coup has been set in motion, you have [From.GetFirstName] detained by your men before holding court. Flanked by your supporters you announce the immediate deposition of [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], and use your powers as regent to name [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] as the true ruler of [Root.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName].;Le coup d'�tat est en marche, vos hommes ont emprisonn� [From.GetFirstName] avant de tenir l'audience. Accompagn� de vos soutiens, vous annoncez la d�position imm�diate de [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], et en appelez � vos pouvoirs de r�gent pour nommer [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] dirigeant de [Root.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName].;;;El golpe palaciego est� en marcha, tus hombres han encarcelado a [From.GetFirstName] antes de la audiencia. Acompa�ado por tus seguidores, anuncias que se ha depuesto a [From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], y apelando a tus poderes como regente nombras a [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [Root.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] dirigente de [Root.SupportedClaimantTitle.GetName].;;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCfaction_event_new.82;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], using my powers as [FromFrom.GetLordLady] Regent, I have had [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] deposed without the need to resort to war. [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] now justly rules in [From.GetHerHis] place.\n\nThank you for your support in this matter,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], suivant mes pouvoirs de [FromFrom.GetLordLady] r�gent(e), j'ai d�pos� [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] sans recourir � la guerre. [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] dirige maintenant � sa place.\n\nMerci pour votre soutien dans cette affaire,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], conforme a mis poderes como regente, he depuesto a [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] sin recurrir a la violencia. [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName] es el nuevo dirigente.\n\nGracias por vuestro apoyo en este asunto,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;;;;;;;x
EVTDESCfaction_event_new.83;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], using my powers as [FromFrom.GetLordLady] Regent of [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName], and with the agreement of the council, I hereby decree that [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] be deposed in favour of [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName], the true ruler of [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName].\n\nSigned,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], suivant mes pouvoirs de [FromFrom.GetLordLady] r�gent(e) de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName], et avec l'accord du conseil, je d�clare par la pr�sente que [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] est d�pos� en faveur de [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName], souverain l�gitime de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName].\n\nSign�,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], conforme a mis poderes como regente de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName], y con el acuerdo del Consejo, declaro que [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] sea depuesto en favor de [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetTitledFirstName] [FromFrom.SupportedClaimant.GetOnlyDynastyName], soberano leg�timo de [From.PrimaryTitle.GetName].\n\nFirmado,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;;;;;;;x
