nominate_military_command_desc;[From.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] is not automatically inherited via family lines, rather its commander is appointed by [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] in [From.Liege.Capital.GetName]. In order to ensure continued [From.GetOnlyDynastyName] presence here perhaps I should petition [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] that [Root.GetTitledFirstName] should be nominated as by successor?;[From.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] n'est pas h�ritable syst�matiquement via un lien familial, mais son commandant est nomm� par [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] � [From.Liege.Capital.GetName]. Pour assurer la pr�sence continuelle des [From.GetOnlyDynastyName], peut-�tre devrais-je demander � [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] que [Root.GetTitledFirstName] soit d�sign� comme successeur ?;;;[From.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] no se hereda a trav�s de un linaje familiar, si no que el mandatario es nombrado por [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] en [From.Liege.Capital.GetName]. Para garantizar la presencia continua de los [From.GetOnlyDynastyName], tal vez deber�a pedir a [From.Liege.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] que [Root.GetTitledFirstName] sea designado como sucesor?;;;;;;;;;x
