EVTDESCdynasty.60;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], I hereby request that my [GetFromFromVsFromRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] be appointed as my successor to [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName]. I assure you [From.GetSheHe] will make an able commander.\n\nYours,\n[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], je requiers par la pr�sente que mon [GetFromFromVsFromRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] soit d�sign� comme mon successeur pour [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName]. Je vous assure qu'[From.GetSheHe] fera un commandant capable.\n\nSinc�rement votre,\n[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;[Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFOA], por la presente solicito que mi [GetFromFromVsFromRelation] [From.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] sea designado como mi sucesor en [FromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName]. Os aseguro que ser� un comandante muy capaz.\n\nVuestro,\n[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty];;;;;;;;;x
