EVTDESCdynasty.62;[Root.GetTitledFirstName], I am afraid I cannot accept your request, [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] shall fall to someone more suitable than [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] when your command is over.\n\nSigned,\n[From.GetTitledFirstName] of House [From.GetOnlyDynastyName];[Root.GetTitledFirstName], je crains de ne pouvoir satisfaire votre requ�te, [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] doit �choir � quelqu'un de plus appropri� que [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] lorsque votre commandement s'ach�vera.\n\nSign�,\n[From.GetTitledFirstName] de la Maison [From.GetOnlyDynastyName];;;[Root.GetTitledFirstName], me temo no poder satisfacer vuestra petici�n, [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] debe elegir a alguien m�s apropiado que [FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty] al finalizar vuesto mandato.\n\nFinalizar,\n[From.GetTitledFirstName] de la casa [From.GetOnlyDynastyName];;;;;;;;;x
