EVTDESC45353;To all subjects of [FromFromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], the inheritance of the [FromFromFromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] has been thrown into question after the untimely death of [FromFromFromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty]. [FromFromFromFrom.GetSheHeCap] left no clear heir, and so I hereby name [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] as [FromFromFromFrom.GetHerHis] lawful heir.\n\nSigned,\n[FromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynastyAndTitle];A tous mes sujets de [FromFromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal], la question de l'h�ritage de [FromFromFromFrom.PrimaryTitle.GetFullName] s'est pos�e suite � la mort pr�matur�e de [FromFromFromFrom.GetTitledFirstNameWithDynasty]. [FromFromFromFrom.GetSheHeCap] n'a pas laiss� d'h�ritier clair, et ainsi je nomme par la pr�sente [From.GetFirstNameWithDynasty] comme h�ritier l�gitime.\n\nSign�,\n[From.GetTitledFirstNameNoRegnal] de la Maison [From.GetOnlyDynastyName], [From.GetRegnalOrdinal] de son nom.;;;;;;;;;;;;x
