EVTDESC_RIP_11053_GREENSEER;Hearing of you desire to find a learned healer, a [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] by the name of [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName] has come to [Root.Capital.GetName]. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] is a suspected skinchanger, being always in the company of a [recruited_physician_target.GetAnimalCompanion]. For this [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] is treated with suspicion by many, but [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] claims to be a greenseer as well as an able healer.;La rumeur dit que vous cherchez un gu�risseur �rudit, un(e) [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] du nom de [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName] est venu � [Root.Capital.GetName]. [Recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] est suspect� d'�tre un change-peau, toujours en compagnie d'un [recruited_physician_target.GetAnimalCompanion]. Pour cela [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] est trait� avec suspicion par beaucoup, mais [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] pr�tend �tre un vervoyant ainsi qu'un gu�risseur comp�tent.;Ein(e) H�ndler(in) der Seidenstra�e ist vor Kurzem in [Root.Capital.GetName] eingetroffen. Eure Wachen berichten, dass [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName]' kostenlose medizinische Untersuchungen anbot, diese Gelegenheit jedoch dazu nutzte, die Lehren Manis zu verbreiten! Die Wachen sperrten [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHim] zum eigenen Schutz ein, doch vielleicht k�nnte [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] an Eurem Hof als Heiler(in) arbeiten?';;Un/a mercader de la Ruta de la seda lleg� recientemente a [Root.Capital.GetName]. Tus guardias te informan que con la excusa de proporcionar ex�menes m�dicos gratuitos, este ''[recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName]' aprovechaba la oportunidad para predicar el Evangelio de Mani! Los guardias [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHim] encerraron por [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHis] propio bien, �pero quiz�s [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] podr�a servirte