EVTDESC_RIP_11053_MAESTER;After a lengthy search, a [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] who could be your physician has been found. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] is a Maester from Westeros by the name of [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName], and is apparently travelling through [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetName] on a quest to gain greater knowledge. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] claims to be well trained in healing, and is offering [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHis] services to you.;Apr�s une longue recherche, un(e) [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] qui pourrait devenir votre gu�risseur a �t� trouv�. [Recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] est un mestre de Westeros du nom de [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName], et apparemment voyage � travers [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetName] � la qu�te d'un savoir plus grand. [Recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] pr�tend �tre bien form�(e) � la gu�rison et vous offre ses services .;;;Despu�s de una larga b�squeda, se ha encontrado un [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] que podr�a ser su m�dico. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] es un Maestro de poniente con el nombre de [recruited_physician_target.GetFirstName], y aparentemente est� viajando a trav�s de [Root.PrimaryTitle.GetName] en una b�squeda para obtener un mayor conocimiento. [recruitited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] dice estar bien capacitado en la curaci�n y le ofrece sus servicios de [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHis].;;;;;;;;;x
