EVTDESC_RIP_11053_SLAVE;Rumours have been circulating around [Root.Capital.GetName] of a [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] who has been healing the peasantry of their ailments and injuries. The [recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman] has been located and brought before you. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] claims to have escaped slavery from a foreign land where [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] was the trained personal physician of [recruited_physician_target.GetHerHis] master. [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] now begs the honour of serving you as a freed[recruited_physician_target.GetManWoman].;Des rumeurs circulent autour de [Root.Capital.GetName] d'un(e) [recruted_physician_target.GetManWoman] qui gu�rit la paysannerie de leurs maux et leurs blessures. [Recruted_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] a �t� localis�(e) et amen�(e) devant vous et  pr�tend avoir �chapp� � l'esclavage dans une terre �trang�re o� [recruited_physician_target.GetSheHe] �tait le m�decin personnel qualifi� de son ma�tre. [Recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] demande maintenant l'honneur de vous servir en tant que  personne libre.;;;Los rumores est�n circulando alrededor de [Root.Capital.GetName] de [recruted_physician_target.GetManWoman] que cura a los campesinos de sus males y heridas. [Recruted_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] ha sido localizado y presentado ante usted y afirma haber escapado de la esclavitud en un pa�s extranjero donde [recruitited_physician_target.GetSheHe] era el m�dico personal capacitado del maestro. [Recruited_physician_target.GetSheHeCap] ahora pide el honor de servirte como una persona libre.;;;;;;;;;x
